{"read_id": "READ-20261116-9451ab", "session_id": "SESSION-20261116-cd06ca", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261116-bcacf9"}, "reading": "interpreted", "note": "Boesch & Tomasello 1998。伝統の内容と累積のラチェットを分離し、再実行経路（模倣・教授）の質で拘束が切り替わると読んだ。", "created_at": "2026-11-16"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261116-bf9f7c", "session_id": "SESSION-20261116-cd06ca", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261116-e72de6"}, "reading": "interpreted", "note": "McGrew 1992。道具の形は再製作がなければ保たれないと読んだ。足場のみの残存では不十分。", "created_at": "2026-11-16"}
